[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD006
TITLE: Handoff while the neighbor link is up
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall send a handoff to a neighbor whose link is up, accept it, and expect the aircraft to leave local control. A second handoff that the neighbor rejects shall leave the aircraft in local control. Acceptance is those two outcomes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Accept and reject are the two answers the interface allows.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STP001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
